      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but it feels pointless. how am i supposed to \"fix\" it when i'm the problem? it's like, no matter what i do, i just make everything worse for everyone. i'm just a constant source of stress for them. if i wasn't here, maybe they could finally just... breathe again.",
