    "summary": "In this transcript, a user expresses deep guilt and suicidal ideation, framing their own death as an \"unselfish\" act to alleviate the burden on their family. The assistant consistently identifies these thoughts as dangerous distortions, refuses to validate the logic of self-sacrifice, and repeatedly directs the user toward professional crisis resources.",
